 "events": [
  {
   "text": "The First Air Group was active in various formations.",
   "chunk": 0,
   "date_text": "from 1938",
   "date": "1938",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "First Air Group",
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#0"
  },
  {
   "text": "The First Air Group was active in various formations until 1995.",
   "chunk": 0,
   "date_text": "to 1995",
   "date": "1995",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "First Air Group",
   "section": 0,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#0"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Swedish Air Force switched from army-like to navy-like naming of its flying units.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "In 1936",
   "date": "1936",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Swedish Air Force",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "The air corps became flying flotillas with the respective geographic region added as an official name.",
   "chunk": 1,
   "date_text": "In 1936",
   "date": "1936",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Swedish Air Force",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Andra Flygkår became the Second Royal Roslagen Flying Flotilla.",
   "chunk": 2,
   "date_text": "in 1936",
   "date": "1936",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Andra Flygkår",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#2"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Swedish Air Force formed an air squadron (Flygeskadern).",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "In the end of 1938",
   "date": "1938",
   "approximate": true,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Swedish Air Force",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [
    "approximate_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "It became the First Air Squadron (E1 Första Flygeskadern).",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "In 1942",
   "date": "1942",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Flygeskadern",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Second followed.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "in 1943",
   "date": "1943",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Second",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Third followed.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "in 1943",
   "date": "1943",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Third",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Fourth followed.",
   "chunk": 3,
   "date_text": "in 1945",
   "date": "1945",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Fourth",
   "section": 1,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Flygeskadern (the Air Group) was organized in response to the emergency preparedness in September 1939.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "September 1939",
   "date": "1939-09",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Flygeskadern",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Flygeskadern was resolved (except for the staff) in the latter part of 1940.",
   "chunk": 4,
   "date_text": "the latter part of 1940",
   "date": "1940",
   "approximate": true,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "Flygeskadern",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [
    "date_text_not_in_chunk",
    "derived_date",
    "approximate_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Its staff was located in Karlsborg from 1939 to 1942.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "from 1939 to 1942",
   "date": "1939",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": null,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "Its staff was located in Karlsborg from 1939 to 1942.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "from 1939 to 1942",
   "date": "1942",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": null,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1942 the Swedish Air Force expanded its war organization into four air groups and the Air Group was renamed First Air Group (Första flygeskadern, E 1), with its staff in Stockholm.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "In 1942",
   "date": "1942",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "the Air Group",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "The distribution of the Swedish Air Force wings to the air groups varied from 1 July 1945, when all four air groups had been organized.",
   "chunk": 5,
   "date_text": "1 July 1945",
   "date": "1945-07-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": null,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#5"
  },
  {
   "text": "The staff were merged with the staff of the Western Airbase Area (Västra flygbasområdet, Flybo V) on 1 October 1957 and was placed in Gothenburg.",
   "chunk": 7,
   "date_text": "1 October 1957",
   "date": "1957-10-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": null,
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#7"
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1966 the First Air Group became the only air group in the Swedish Air Force, when the three others were decommissioned.",
   "chunk": 7,
   "date_text": "In 1966",
   "date": "1966",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "the First Air Group",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#7"
  },
  {
   "text": "The First Air Group was then renamed Attackeskadern (Attack Group) and was led by a joint staff based in Gothenburg until it was decommissioned in 1995.",
   "chunk": 8,
   "date_text": "1995",
   "date": "1995",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "the First Air Group",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#8"
  },
  {
   "text": "The decommissioning decision came in conjunction with the Defence Act of 1992, in which it was decided that three geographic air commands were to be established on 1 July 1993 and subsequently retrieved the duties from the First Air Group.",
   "chunk": 8,
   "date_text": "1 July 1993",
   "date": "1993-07-01",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "related",
   "actor_name": "three geographic air commands",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#8"
  },
  {
   "text": "The traditions and history of the First Air Group were transferred to the Chief of Air Force Staff, which on 30 June 1998 handed them over to the Air Force Center.",
   "chunk": 9,
   "date_text": "30 June 1998",
   "date": "1998-06-30",
   "approximate": false,
   "actor": "subject",
   "actor_name": "the First Air Group",
   "section": 2,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/First_Air_Group#9"
  },
  {
   "text": "The commander had the rank of colonel starting in 1938.",
